==Icelandic==
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|himinn|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*himinaz||clous cover, sky}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhɪːmɪnː/|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|himins|himnar}}

# a [[sky]], the [[heavens]]{{jump|is|sky|s}}
#: ''Við lágum undir berum '''himni'''.''
#:: We lay under the open '''sky'''.
# {{context|in the plural|lang=is}} [[heaven]], [[paradise]]{{jump|is|heaven|s}}

